  "idea": "Cyberchef: the swiss army knife for data conversion and formatting",
  "text": "If you ever need to decode, format, clean, or convert messy text, bookmark this. Wrangling garbled strings or mangled JSON usually involves jumping across multiple ad-filled converter sites. Pasting sensitive API tokens or client payloads into random online tools creates massive security leaks. CyberChef solves this by running hundreds of data recipes entirely inside your client-side browser. You transform complex records safely in seconds.",
